    <paragraph>Find and Evaluate Composite Functions</paragraph>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, find ⓐ (f ∘ g)(x), ⓑ (g ∘ f)(x), and ⓒ (f · g)(x).</paragraph>
    <exercise number="1" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$f(x) = 4x + 3$$ and $$g(x) = 2x + 5$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$8x+238x+23$$ ⓑ $$8x+118x+11$$ ⓒ $$8x2+26x+158x2+26x+15$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
