    <paragraph>In the following exercises, find the inverse of each function. Determine the domain and range of the inverse function.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="21" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\left\{ {\left( {2,1} \right),\left( {4,2} \right),\left( {6,3} \right),\left( {8,4} \right)} \right\}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>Inverse function: $${(1,2),(2,4),(3,6),(4,8)}.{(1,2),(2,4),(3,6),(4,8)}.$$ Domain: $${1,2,3,4}.{1,2,3,4}.$$ Range: $${2,4,6,8}.{2,4,6,8}.$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="22" has_solution="false">
