        <paragraph>Inverse function: $${(-2,0),(3,1),(7,2),(12,3)}.{(-2,0),(3,1),(7,2),(12,3)}.$$ Domain: $${-2,3,7,12}.{-2,3,7,12}.$$ Range: $${0,1,2,3}.{0,1,2,3}.$$</paragraph>
